<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 120,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 120,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est receipts 120,000, Wk ago 116,000, and Yr ago 108,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $2.00 lower than mid-session Friday. Trade was active for light demand and heavy offerings. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
